WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.580
You ripped every CD.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.230
You run your own server.

3
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.770
So why does it still feel like a spreadsheet?

4
00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:08.830
Meet Triptych.

5
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:11.610
One library.

6
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:13.090
Three looks.

7
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.260
Switch whenever you like.

8
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.420
Synced lyrics, line by line.

9
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.820
Your listening stats.

10
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:24.020
And your whole year, Wrapped.

11
00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.580
Gapless playback, with crossfade.

12
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.240
And it shows on your Discord status.

13
00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.160
On every device you own.

14
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.200
And yes, the cat jams to the bass.

15
00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:38.730
Triptych.

16
00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:40.490
Free and open source.
